        "q": "Does this calculator include Etsy Offsite Ads or currency conversion fees?",
        "a": "No. It covers the standard listing, transaction, and payment processing fees. Offsite Ads fees (15% or 12%), currency conversion, and regulatory operating fees in some countries are not included and would reduce your profit further if they apply."
